@startuml deposit-flow
<style>
activityDiagram {
  FontName Inter
  FontSize 14
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  activity {
    BackgroundColor #F1F5F9
    LineColor #CBD5E1
    LineThickness 1
    RoundCorner 12
    FontColor #1E293B
    Padding 14
    Margin 12
  }
  arrow {
    LineColor #64748B
    LineThickness 1.5
    FontColor #64748B
    FontSize 12
  }
  swimlane {
    LineColor #E2E8F0
    FontColor #334155
    FontStyle bold
  }
  circle {
    BackgroundColor #64748B
    LineColor #64748B
  }
  partition {
    BackgroundColor #F0FDFA
    LineColor #99D6CC
    FontColor #0F766E
    RoundCorner 12
  }
  .decision {
    BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
    LineColor #93C5FD
    FontColor #1E40AF
  }
  .settlement {
    BackgroundColor #CCFBF1
    LineColor #5BBBA9
    FontColor #115E59
  }
}
</style>

|Manager|
|Depositor|

|Manager|
start
:**1. Approve general access**\nCreate AccessAttestation\nafter off-ledger KYB; <<decision>>
:**2. Grant per-vault access**\nCreate VaultAccess\nreferencing the attestation; <<decision>>
-> Access granted;

|Depositor|
:**3. Request a deposit**\nExercise Deposit on VaultAccess; <<decision>>
:Fetch active **AccessAttestation**\nCheck manager and depositor;
:Lock tokens in an allocation;
:Create **DepositRequest**;
-> Request ready;

|Manager|
:**4. Accept the deposit**\nExercise AcceptDeposit\non DepositRequest; <<decision>>
:Fetch active **AccessAttestation**\nCheck manager and depositor;
partition "" {
  :**Atomic settlement**\nTransfer locked tokens\nto **vault treasury**; <<settlement>>
  :Mint **Share**\nfor the **depositor**; <<settlement>>
}
stop

@enduml
